kdna-web-client provides explicit browser file selection through public
Core admission and bounded remote Read through the public transport receiver.

This package never performs decryption or license verification.
The embedding supplies an explicit endpoint and transport context. The
trusted Host controls disclosure; a received view grants no local action
authority and does not prove remote identity or authorization.

